[{"title":"孝弟忠信礼义廉耻八字赞 其三","author":"张天赋","text":"忠忠忠，朝廷教养恩无穷。\n一朝出仕随官职，犬马勤劳报主翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3695,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孝弟忠信礼义廉耻八字赞 其四","author":"张天赋","text":"信信信，人生赖此为司命。\n无信徒然血肉躯，牛马襟裾何足敬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3696,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孝弟忠信礼义廉耻八字赞 其五","author":"张天赋","text":"礼礼礼，天下古今人共履。\n纲常万古重如山，须要持循有文理。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3697,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孝弟忠信礼义廉耻八字赞 其六","author":"张天赋","text":"义义义，寸心藉此为裁制。\n遵行正路不差移，四通八达无颠踬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3698,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孝弟忠信礼义廉耻八字赞 其七","author":"张天赋","text":"廉廉廉，本分之外莫求添。\n贪泉不改夷齐操，煮石餐霞味亦甜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3699,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孝弟忠信礼义廉耻八字赞 其八","author":"张天赋","text":"耻耻耻，一事不如人所鄙。\n直须猛省洗前羞，进入圣贤门户里。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3700,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题一路功名到白头 其一","author":"张天赋","text":"髫龀岐嶷男子身，文章事业便惊人。\n天衢驰骋无留碍，躩跞潇潇两鬓银。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3701,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题一路功名到白头 其二","author":"张天赋","text":"大夫谈笑便封侯，荡荡天衢纵步游。\n茂烈英声临海宇，喜看霜满鬓边秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3702,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题喜沐恩波到白头","author":"张天赋","text":"鸠宅吾巢已可怜，一朝仰面见青天。\n六龙驾上春如海，喜沐恩波到百年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3703,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游杭州西湖","author":"张天赋","text":"游遍西湖过六桥，数株杨柳间株桃。\n好怀更向孤山醉，收拾莺花别样娇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3704,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过罗浮","author":"张天赋","text":"一见罗浮费我吟，登高深切此生心。\n飞云顶上甘泉笔，又与山灵作古今。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3705,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题柏","author":"张天赋","text":"何意群芳摇落时，独于冷处挺丰姿。\n质生已厚贞元气，肯向风霜息此机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3706,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"爱梅自况","author":"张天赋","text":"南海梦生都水月，东墙喜见旧阳春。\n临风为问林和靖，千载凭谁是后身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3707,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题李子长为写爱梅图因题","author":"张天赋","text":"原是一阳初动处，叶冈刚说是花王。\n当今若泥唐人意，请问南山李子长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3708,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题梅","author":"张天赋","text":"千红万紫谢芳林，独向江南报好音。\n正是一阳来复处，令人开眼见天心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3709,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云窝裁柏题壁间","author":"张天赋","text":"种柏山斋不等閒，贞资劲节可人看。\n遥知应有参天日，分付儿曹守岁寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3710,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"伤美女游春","author":"张天赋","text":"独怜金屋阿娇身，误踏东风紫陌尘。\n到底看春春不见，反教人看我为春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3711,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"公廨门神","author":"张天赋","text":"豪气冲霄壮士心，威风赫赫鬼神钦。\n可怜一把黄金斧，不斩人怀暮夜金。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3712,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题扇面","author":"张天赋","text":"画桨兰舟不等閒，焉能久滞五湖间。\n一篙着尽男儿力，早过龙门第一关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3713,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢游冈兄端午惠兰花","author":"张天赋","text":"才沐兰汤又插兰，天香何以到人间。\n竹床散发西窗睡，悟入花神几个关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3714,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送何时眷返驾惠阳","author":"张天赋","text":"笑折梅花赠故人，眼前光景一时新。\n铁桥仰面罗浮上，万紫千红别有春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3715,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏王柬岩","author":"张天赋","text":"麻石高风绝点埃，仙葩灵种倚云栽。\n谁知也放窥春眼，流水天台透出来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3716,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贡院门","author":"张天赋","text":"低声门外问殷勤，十八年前许嫁君。\n脂粉至今犹检点，不妨春老谩成婚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3717,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登越王台","author":"张天赋","text":"一眺天南了四围，高丘山水望中微。\n丈夫不跨扬州鹤，终见凌空拄杖飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3718,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游海珠寺","author":"张天赋","text":"海上天然浪结堆，倚空楼阁似翚飞。\n刹那好景都收拾，醉带祥云满地归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3719,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其一","author":"张天赋","text":"枝头生意日相催，不用东风着力吹。\n笑杀百花都未放，却从头上占春魁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3720,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其二","author":"张天赋","text":"老树差芽雪里开，东风头上百花魁。\n当时结实归商鼎，曾展调羹手段来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3721,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈草堂观澜书屋","author":"张天赋","text":"孟氏观澜有妙方，眼前光景是沧浪。\n寥寥此际无人会，白日青天见草堂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3722,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山翁乐","author":"张天赋","text":"白云深处是谁家，跣足蓬头飧紫霞。\n石洞愿教无处入，恐惊分我一山花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3723,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"着三眼屐","author":"张天赋","text":"捲舒在我有圆方，铁石难磨锦绣肠。\n世路但凭三眼屐，不妨徐步上高岗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3724,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙酉秋饮李村黎宅后园","author":"张天赋","text":"闻说李村全是李，我来见竹又成村。\n竹山欲到嗟无及，千里令人望白云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3725,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李村望罗浮","author":"张天赋","text":"罗浮万丈摩晴空，朱明日日皆春风。\n何当跨鹤飞云顶，数尽高低大小峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3726,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋闰寻思","author":"张天赋","text":"捣罢寒衣寄罢书，关山极目意踌躇。\n夜来纸帐西风急，寒到君边衣到无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3727,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿高隐八旬为顺德梁鸣汉索显次南海伦白山太史韵","author":"张天赋","text":"深入罗浮一遁嘉，铁桥流水饱胡麻。\n曾经甲子四百八，还看蟠桃几度花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3728,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"追昔","author":"张天赋","text":"松楸长号风未恬，夜台寂寂如空禅。\n妆台冷落五更月，收泪低头学子骞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3729,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"扇面尽有感","author":"张天赋","text":"隐坐青松二老翁，伴尽江山几万重。\n壶里乾坤真自得，任渠横直醉东风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3730,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题尽","author":"张天赋","text":"何处丹青妙入神，笔端拗出桃源春。\n黄云碧嶂閒春色，应有知机人避秦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3731,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢罗如山","author":"张天赋","text":"带醉相辞带夜行，清歌犹在枕边声。\n醒来拄杖门前立，又送如山满眼青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3732,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仲夏写怀","author":"张天赋","text":"长傍青山与白云，一溪流水绕柴门。\n竹床睡起无馀事，风送荷香正启樽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3733,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庚戌四月十四日","author":"张天赋","text":"曲肱而枕乐有馀，夫子当年不我诬。\n无梦坦然无障碍，就教有梦亦安舒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3734,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庚戌秋夜梦与甘泉先生讲有道者心无老少之异一句反覆不辍既觉是梦复梦诗云","author":"张天赋","text":"有道心皆老少然，秋霄清梦见先生。\n画前本有无言易，不向梅花讲后天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3735,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题便面陈抟先生","author":"张天赋","text":"野心已被白云留。\n一睡人间数十秋。\n莫道化羊为幻事，华山风景尚悠悠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3736,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"瓜","author":"张天赋","text":"青门谁识种瓜心，道义行藏酌量深。\n我爱蔓延香不断，及期应许报泥金。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3737,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贰十四孝图","author":"张天赋","text":"子养亲兮妇养姑，祖孙兄弟尽归图。\n莫贪画彩徒然看，须把身心学步趋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":